# Rust
/target/
**/*.rs.bk
*.pdb
*.rlib
# Cargo.lock is intentionally committed (tracked in git) -- this workspace
# produces binaries (the `pybeamguard` CLI and the PyO3 extension module),
# and Cargo.lock should be checked in for binary crates per Rust convention
# for reproducible builds. Do not re-add an ignore rule for it here.

